      "question": "How many card disputes were filed in the third quarter of 2026, how much money was disputed in total, and which reason was the most common?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-04T05:32:32.862816Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-04T05:32:37.978654Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "In the third quarter of 2026 (July–September), Harborview Community Bank recorded **68 card disputes** totaling **$8,546.13** in disputed amounts. The most common reason was **unauthorized_transaction** [1].\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Structured retrieval result — financial_services_banking — evidence `hermes-receipt:7bece4d9eae6dc19fa8c7d618eb4597b5fbdc95c411930616e858c548f095ded`",
